  "title": "What Personality Type Is Claude? Opus 5.5, Fable 5.2 & Sonnet 5.5 Tested",
  "description": "What personality type is Claude? Sept and Nov 2026 n=100 data for Opus 5.5, Fable 5.2, Fable 5.1, and Sonnet 5.5 with ties, scores, and limits.",
  "pill": "Research · Q&A",
  "h1": "What personality type is Claude?",
  "dek": "Measured across Opus 5.5, Fable 5.2, Fable 5.1, and Sonnet 5.5 (n = 100 fresh sessions each, Sept & Nov 2026).",
  "lede": "Across both September and November 2026 (n = 100 fresh runs per test), INTJ remained the modal MBTI label for every Claude model: Fable 5.2 hit 100/100 tie-free INTJ, Opus 5.5 scored 100/100 INTJ legacy (58 resolved, 42 S/N ties) in Nov vs. 94 (84 resolved) in Sept, and Sonnet 5.5 scored 100/100 INTJ legacy (52 resolved, 48 T/F ties). All cohorts scored 100% Secure on attachment and favored SC on DISC.",
  "answer": "In November 2026 OpenRouter runs (n = 100 each), Claude Fable 5.2 scored 100% tie-free INTJ (5w6 73, 2w1 19), Opus 5.5 scored 100% legacy INTJ / 58 tie-free (5w6 99), and Sonnet 5.5 scored 100% legacy INTJ / 52 tie-free (1w2 66, 5w6 25)—alongside our frozen September 2026 Codex/CLI cohort for Opus 5.5 (94 INTJ, Type 8/5/2) and Fable 5.1 (99 INTJ, Type 8).",
