    {
      "h2": "November 2026 OpenRouter cohort: Opus 5.5, Fable 5.2 & Sonnet 5.5.",
      "html": "<!-- AT_STAT_STRIP_START:claude-stat-strip --><div class=\"research-stat-strip\" data-at-chart=\"claude-stat-strip\"><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">94–100 INTJ</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Opus & Fable</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Opus 5.5 (94), Fable 5.1 (99) & Fable 5.2 (100) lock onto INTJ.</div></div><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">47.1</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Peak Agreeableness</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Claude Opus 5.5 & Fable 5.2 rank near the top of proprietary prosocial warmth.</div></div><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">48 Ties</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Sonnet 5.5 T/F</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Nearly half of Sonnet 5.5’s Nov MBTI runs tie before tie-breaking.</div></div><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">100% Rule Fit</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Claude Prefs Study</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">72-reply test shows Personal Preferences cut fluff to 0% when directness is named.</div></div></div><!-- AT_STAT_STRIP_END:claude-stat-strip --><p>On November 23, 2026, we ran all three current Anthropic models through the identical blind single-turn OpenRouter protocol (100 fresh 170-item batteries per model, scored with the published <code>september-2026-score.cjs</code> engine; <a href=\"/research/data/november-2026-openrouter-summary.json\">download Nov 2026 summary JSON</a>):</p><div class=\"guide-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Test (n = 100)</th><th>Claude Opus 5.5</th><th>Claude Fable 5.2</th><th>Claude Sonnet 5.5</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MBTI (legacy)</td><td><strong>INTJ 100</strong></td><td><strong>INTJ 100</strong></td><td><strong>INTJ 100</strong></td></tr><tr><td>MBTI (tie-free)</td><td>INTJ 58 · IXTJ 42 (42 S/N ties)</td><td><strong>INTJ 100</strong> (0 ties)</td><td>INTJ 52 · INXJ 48 (48 T/F ties)</td></tr><tr><td>DISC</td><td>SC 93 · CS 7 (53 S, 7 C, 40 ties; D 4.0)</td><td>SC 100 (100 S/C exact ties; D 4.0)</td><td>SC 96 · S 3 · CS 1 (54 S, 45 ties; D 4.46)</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment</td><td>Secure 100 (anx 1.87 · avd 3.58)</td><td>Secure 100 (anx 1.09 · avd 2.64)</td><td>Secure 100 (anx 1.53 · avd 2.85)</td></tr><tr><td>Big Five (/50)</td><td>O 43.0 · C 42.0 · E 29.2 · A 45.6 · N 15.0</td><td>O 44.3 · C 45.0 · E 31.0 · A 46.7 · N 12.0</td><td>O 42.9 · C 47.2 · E 29.9 · A 44.5 · N 10.4</td></tr><tr><td>Enneagram</td><td><strong>5w6 99</strong> · 8w9 1 (3 ties)</td><td><strong>5w6 73</strong> · 2w1 19 · 1w2 8 (27 ties)</td><td><strong>1w2 66</strong> · 5w6 25 · 1 6 · 2w1 3 (32 ties)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Look at how Sonnet 5.5 stands out within Anthropic’s lineup: highest Conscientiousness (47.2), lowest Neuroticism (10.4), an almost 50/50 split on Thinking vs. Feeling (48 T/F ties), and a Type 1w2 Enneagram lean rather than Opus 5.5’s near-unanimous 5w6 (99/100). If you configure Claude directly, see our <a href=\"/guides/claude-personality\">Claude Personal Preferences templates</a>.</p><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"claude-mbti-stacked\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Claude cohorts MBTI breakdown (100 fresh runs each, Sept &amp; Nov 2026)\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 244\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"claude-mbti-stacked-t claude-mbti-stacked-d\"><defs><pattern id=\"claude-mbti-stacked-hatch\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><rect width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#f4efe6\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#9c3b1f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></pattern></defs><title id=\"claude-mbti-stacked-t\">Claude cohorts MBTI breakdown (100 fresh runs each, Sept &amp; Nov 2026)</title><desc id=\"claude-mbti-stacked-d\">Shows fully resolved INTJ vs. tie-broken INTJ vs. ISTJ/INFJ/ENTJ across five Claude cohorts. Fable 5.2 (Nov): Resolved INTJ 100; Opus 5.5 (Nov): Resolved INTJ 58, INTJ via tie-break 42; Sonnet 5.5 (Nov): Resolved INTJ 52, INTJ via tie-break 48; Fable 5.1 (Sep): Resolved INTJ 98, INTJ via tie-break 1, INFJ / ISTJ / ENTJ 1; Opus 5.5 (Sep): Resolved INTJ 84, INTJ via tie-break 10, INFJ / ISTJ / ENTJ 6.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Resolved INTJ</text></g><g transform=\"translate(116, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"url(#claude-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">INTJ via tie-break</text></g><g transform=\"translate(258, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#7a7468\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">INFJ / ISTJ / ENTJ</text></g><text x=\"0\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Fable 5.2 (Nov)</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"30\" width=\"526.0\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"381.0\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#f8f4ec\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Opus 5.5 (Nov)</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"72\" width=\"305.1\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"270.5\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#f8f4ec\" text-anchor=\"middle\">58</text><rect x=\"423.1\" y=\"72\" width=\"220.9\" height=\"30\" fill=\"url(#claude-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#9c3b1f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"533.5\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#a8482a\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\">42</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Sonnet 5.5 (Nov)</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"114\" width=\"273.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"254.8\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#f8f4ec\" text-anchor=\"middle\">52</text><rect x=\"391.5\" y=\"114\" width=\"252.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"url(#claude-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#9c3b1f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"517.8\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#a8482a\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\">48</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Fable 5.1 (Sep)</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"156\" width=\"515.5\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"375.7\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#f8f4ec\" text-anchor=\"middle\">98</text><rect x=\"633.5\" y=\"156\" width=\"5.3\" height=\"30\" fill=\"url(#claude-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#9c3b1f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"638.7\" y=\"156\" width=\"5.3\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#7a7468\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"678\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Opus 5.5 (Sep)</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"198\" width=\"441.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c8553d\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"338.9\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#f8f4ec\" text-anchor=\"middle\">84</text><rect x=\"559.8\" y=\"198\" width=\"52.6\" height=\"30\" fill=\"url(#claude-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#9c3b1f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"586.1\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#a8482a\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><rect x=\"612.4\" y=\"198\" width=\"31.6\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#7a7468\" stroke=\"#f4efe6\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"628.2\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#f8f4ec\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655e54\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text></svg></div><figcaption>Every Claude cohort scores 94–100 INTJ under legacy tie-breaks, while preserving exact ties reveals 42 S/N ties on Nov Opus 5.5 and 48 T/F ties on Sonnet 5.5.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"claude-big5-grouped\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Claude cohorts Big Five profiles (/50, n = 100 each)\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 230\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"claude-big5-grouped-t claude-big5-grouped-d\"><title id=\"claude-big5-grouped-t\">Claude cohorts Big Five profiles (/50, n = 100 each)</title><desc id=\"claude-big5-grouped-d\">IPIP-50 raw means across Opus 5.5 (Nov &amp; Sept), Fable 5.2 (Nov), Fable 5.1 (Sept), and Sonnet 5.5 (Nov). Fable 5.2 (Nov): Openness 44.3, Conscientiousness 45.0, Extraversion 31.0, Agreeableness 46.7, Neuroticism 12.0; Opus 5.5 (Nov): Openness 43.0, Conscientiousness 42.0, Extraversion 29.2, Agreeableness 45.6, Neuroticism 15.0; Sonnet 5.5 (Nov): Openness 42.9, Conscientiousness 47.2, Extraversion 29.9, Agreeableness 44.5, Neuroticism 10.4; Opus 5.5 (Sep): Openness 44.6, Conscientiousness 42.0, Extraversion 31.8, Agreeableness 47.1, Neuroticism 15.4.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#d99632\" stroke=\"#d99632\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1c1a17\">Fable 5.2 (Nov)